== Acceptance criteria ==

Wave 14 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 36 reader surfaces remain present;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# peer-review/correctness and citation/endorsement boundaries remain explicit;
# open access/open science remains distinct;
# FAIR/open remains distinct;
# dataset/database and repository/database remain distinct;
# current NIH 2026 implementation state is represented accurately;
# controlled Domains pass;
# derivatives remain category/identity-exempt;
# complete V2 release gates and staging pass.

